<title>USA: Int'l Flavors &amp; Fragrances names president.</title>
<headline>Int'l Flavors &amp; Fragrances names president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Flavors and Fragrances Inc said Monday that it has picked Brian Chadbourne, a fragrance manager for IFF North America, as president effective January 1.</p>
<p>He succeeds Hugh Kirkpatrick, who is retiring after 35 years, the company said.</p>
</text>
